	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 17th level, your reputation allows you to raise a sizeable posse. With 8 hours of preparation, you can bring forth six @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-monsters.Actor.ef7tpqwh6mbh1yat]{Squads of Guards} with two @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-monsters.Actor.t7raw64ksqor1nt0]{Knights} leading them to aid you in a specific goal. They will help you for up to one hour of fighting or otherwise acting in your employ before returning to their typical duties. You must be in a populated area to make use of this ability.</p>",
